        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>23初级会计实务22条公式</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n        color: #000;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        padding: 20px;\n        max-width: 800px;\n        background-color: #fff;\n    }\n    .header {\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 32px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .header .black { color: #000; }\n    .header .red { color: #ff0000; }\n    .header .blue { color: #00b0f0; }\n    \n    .section {\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n        font-size: 18px;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n        color: #c00000;\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n    .formula-line {\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n    .highlight-blue {\n        color: #00b0f0;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"header\">\n    <span class=\"black\">23初级会计</span><span class=\"red\">实务</span><span class=\"blue\">22条公式</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">1. 固定资产余额. 净值. 价值公式：</div>\n    <div class=\"formula-line\"><span class=\"highlight-blue\">账面余额</span>=固定资产账面原价</div>\n    <div class=\"formula-line\"><span class=\"highlight-blue\">账面净值</span>=固定资产原价-累计折旧</div>\n    <div class=\"formula-line\">账面价值=固定资产原价-固定资产减值准备-累计折<br>旧</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">2.无形资产资产余额. 净值. 价值公式：</div>\n    <div class=\"formula-line\"><span class=\"highlight-blue\">账面余额</span>=无形资产账面原价</div>\n    <div class=\"formula-line\"><span class=\"highlight-blue\">账面净值</span>=无形资产原价-累计摊销</div>\n    <div class=\"formula-line\"><span class=\"highlight-blue\">账面价值</span>=无形资产原价-无形资产减值准备-累计摊<br>销</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">3. 存货采购成本：</div>\n    <div class=\"formula-line\">\n        =买价+进口关税+其他税费+运费+装卸费+保险费<br>\n        +其他可归属于存货达到预定可使用状态 前的合理费<br>\n        用(在存货采购过程中发生的仓储费、包装费、运输途<br>\n        中的合理损耗、入库前的挑 选整理费用)\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">4. 月末一次加权平均法计算公式：</div>\n    <div class=\"formula-line\">\n        存货单位成本=(月初结存存货成本+$\\Sigma$(本月各批进<br>\n        货的实际单位成本本月各批进货的数量)) /(月初结<br>\n        存存货数量+本月各批进货数量之和)\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
